{"id":"c36","stage":5,"title":"把观点写清楚","scene":"把口头讨论转为正式的书面论证。","roles":["研究伙伴","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c36-1","ko":"이제 논의한 내용을 짧은 글로 정리해 볼까요?","zh":"现在把讨论内容整理成一篇短文，好吗？","note":"从对话过渡到书面表达。","words":[{"term":"논의하다","zh":"讨论","id":"2946c2b99af49e7f","audio":"/audio/2946c2b99af49e7fbf67.mp3"},{"term":"정리하다","zh":"整理","id":"7b53a03fb69e532d","audio":"/audio/7b53a03fb69e532df421.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/f1a5b79d2299e998ad9f.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제表示到这一阶段。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}]},{"text":"논의한","meaning":"讨论过的","explanation":"논의하다（讨论）+ -ㄴ（过去定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"논의하다","audio":"/audio/2946c2b99af49e7fbf67.mp3"}]},{"text":"내용을","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용（内容）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"내용을","audio":"/audio/666977270e450d47deca.mp3"}]},{"text":"짧은","meaning":"短的","explanation":"짧다（短）+ -은（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"짧은","audio":"/audio/4eb5ee7c900ba65a43e0.mp3"}]},{"text":"글로","meaning":"成文章","explanation":"글（文章）+ 로（变化结果；ㄹ收音后用로）。","readings":[{"term":"글로","audio":"/audio/c03c3a69dd6411fc5fc9.mp3"}]},{"text":"정리해","meaning":"整理","explanation":"정리하다（整理）→ 정리해，连接보다。","readings":[{"term":"정리하다","audio":"/audio/7b53a03fb69e532df421.mp3"}]},{"text":"볼까요?","meaning":"试试好吗？","explanation":"보다 + -ㄹ까요（提议）；-아/어 볼까요表示一起试做。","readings":[{"term":"볼까요","audio":"/audio/babde64dd2f76e301f44.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c36-2","ko":"서론에서는 문제를 제기하고 입장을 밝혀야겠어요.","zh":"引言中应提出问题并表明立场。","note":"서론：引言；본론：主体论述。","words":[{"term":"서론","zh":"引言","id":"3f3ba3d9e6515fc8","audio":"/audio/3f3ba3d9e6515fc8d657.mp3"},{"term":"제기하다","zh":"提出","id":"b63f52e485474dcf","audio":"/audio/b63f52e485474dcf93e1.mp3"},{"term":"입장","zh":"立场","id":"313416dc1509fceb","audio":"/audio/313416dc1509fceb95fd.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/0360f77fb8c05e34b18b.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"서론에서는","meaning":"在引言中","explanation":"서론（引言）+ 에서（范围）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"서론","audio":"/audio/3f3ba3d9e6515fc8d657.mp3"}]},{"text":"문제를","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제（问题）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"문제를","audio":"/audio/8af57ae2549d94f339ad.mp3"}]},{"text":"제기하고","meaning":"提出并","explanation":"제기하다（提出问题）+ -고（连接）。","readings":[{"term":"제기하다","audio":"/audio/b63f52e485474dcf93e1.mp3"}]},{"text":"입장을","meaning":"立场","explanation":"입장（立场）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"입장","audio":"/audio/313416dc1509fceb95fd.mp3"}]},{"text":"밝혀야겠어요.","meaning":"应表明","explanation":"밝히다（阐明、表明）→ 밝혀야겠어요；-아/어야为必须，-겠-表判断。","readings":[{"term":"밝혀야겠어요","audio":"/audio/36e5a19e7cef0375c760.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c36-3","ko":"본론에서는 근거와 구체적인 사례를 연결하세요.","zh":"主体部分请把依据和具体事例联系起来。","note":"用具体事例支撑论点。","words":[{"term":"본론","zh":"主体论述","id":"33bab4548eeabf4c","audio":"/audio/33bab4548eeabf4c4be7.mp3"},{"term":"구체적","zh":"具体的","id":"b3bef5fa2aa9a195","audio":"/audio/b3bef5fa2aa9a1953855.mp3"},{"term":"사례","zh":"事例","id":"a8c28ca1d4ffbd68","audio":"/audio/a8c28ca1d4ffbd688e29.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/b00bd802fd242f2c3636.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"본론에서는","meaning":"在主体部分","explanation":"본론（主体论述）+ 에서（范围）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"본론","audio":"/audio/33bab4548eeabf4c4be7.mp3"}]},{"text":"근거와","meaning":"依据和","explanation":"근거（依据）+ 와（和）。","readings":[{"term":"근거와","audio":"/audio/0232bed22f980f9a156c.mp3"}]},{"text":"구체적인","meaning":"具体的","explanation":"구체적（具体的）+ 이다（是）+ -ㄴ（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"구체적","audio":"/audio/b3bef5fa2aa9a1953855.mp3"}]},{"text":"사례를","meaning":"事例","explanation":"사례（事例）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"사례","audio":"/audio/a8c28ca1d4ffbd688e29.mp3"}]},{"text":"연결하세요.","meaning":"请联系起来","explanation":"연결하다（连接）+ -세요（礼貌指示）。","readings":[{"term":"연결하세요","audio":"/audio/a1938e532efe37a13bc3.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c36-4","ko":"반론을 검토한 뒤에 제 주장의 범위를 조정하겠습니다.","zh":"考察反对论点后，我会调整自己主张的适用范围。","note":"不是一味强化主张，而是根据证据调整。","words":[{"term":"반론","zh":"反对论点","id":"4ab69550623afc4f","audio":"/audio/4ab69550623afc4f97d6.mp3"},{"term":"검토하다","zh":"考察","id":"3b822ac1f688f702","audio":"/audio/3b822ac1f688f702b830.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/428cdd03697054c0b83f.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"반론을","meaning":"反对论点","explanation":"반론（反对论点）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"반론","audio":"/audio/4ab69550623afc4f97d6.mp3"}]},{"text":"검토한","meaning":"考察过的","explanation":"검토하다（考察）+ -ㄴ（过去定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"검토하다","audio":"/audio/3b822ac1f688f702b830.mp3"}]},{"text":"뒤에","meaning":"之后","explanation":"뒤（后）+ 에（时间）。","readings":[{"term":"뒤에","audio":"/audio/0350898692fd4601facb.mp3"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我的","explanation":"저의（我的，谦称）的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}]},{"text":"주장의","meaning":"主张的","explanation":"주장（主张）+ 의（所属关系）。","readings":[{"term":"주장의","audio":"/audio/1bfd3ac759b589610015.mp3"}]},{"text":"범위를","meaning":"范围","explanation":"범위（范围）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"범위를","audio":"/audio/dc330b6632e8e89e85d0.mp3"}]},{"text":"조정하겠습니다.","meaning":"我会调整","explanation":"조정하다（调整）+ -겠-（意愿）+ -습니다（正式礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"조정하겠습니다","audio":"/audio/15b974839218397d1796.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c36-5","ko":"결론에서는 새로운 논점보다 핵심 내용을 종합하는 게 좋아요.","zh":"结论中，最好综合核心内容，而非提出新论点。","note":"종합하다：综合。","words":[{"term":"결론","zh":"结论","id":"ce5da34183dc53ab","audio":"/audio/ce5da34183dc53ab86fe.mp3"},{"term":"논점","zh":"论点","id":"9fb6f889eedbd52d","audio":"/audio/9fb6f889eedbd52dd047.mp3"},{"term":"종합하다","zh":"综合","id":"c65aee978076d2f1","audio":"/audio/c65aee978076d2f1e812.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/0c04d2d00a4d97d62bbd.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"결론에서는","meaning":"在结论中","explanation":"결론（结论）+ 에서（范围）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"결론","audio":"/audio/ce5da34183dc53ab86fe.mp3"}]},{"text":"새로운","meaning":"新的","explanation":"새롭다（新）→ 새로운，ㅂ不规则的定语形。","readings":[{"term":"새로운","audio":"/audio/e385dcc20a68fd498495.mp3"}]},{"text":"논점보다","meaning":"比起论点","explanation":"논점（论点）+ 보다（比较基准）；由语境补出“提出新论点”。","readings":[{"term":"논점","audio":"/audio/9fb6f889eedbd52dd047.mp3"}]},{"text":"핵심","meaning":"核心","explanation":"핵심修饰내용。","readings":[{"term":"핵심","audio":"/audio/2667257de74764c7444b.mp3"}]},{"text":"내용을","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용（内容）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"내용을","audio":"/audio/666977270e450d47deca.mp3"}]},{"text":"종합하는","meaning":"综合的","explanation":"종합하다（综合）+ -는（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"종합하다","audio":"/audio/c65aee978076d2f1e812.mp3"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事","explanation":"것이的缩略，将综合行为名词化。","readings":[{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}]},{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"更好","explanation":"좋다的礼貌形式，-는 게 좋다表示建议。","readings":[{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c36-6","ko":"마지막으로 문장 간의 연결과 문체의 일관성을 점검하겠습니다.","zh":"最后，我会检查句间衔接和文体一致性。","note":"正式书面文体通常需要保持终结语尾一致。","words":[{"term":"문장","zh":"句子","id":"22f146433241fd2a","audio":"/audio/22f146433241fd2aa3fe.mp3"},{"term":"문체","zh":"文体","id":"b57d0f42b7a12ad5","audio":"/audio/b57d0f42b7a12ad54a19.mp3"},{"term":"일관성","zh":"一致性","id":"3ec6c9b52005ff80","audio":"/audio/3ec6c9b52005ff80e471.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/14e8fa527d3cce553475.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"마지막으로","meaning":"最后","explanation":"마지막（最后）+ 으로（顺序）。","readings":[{"term":"마지막으로","audio":"/audio/0606b3dd40050c6c83a0.mp3"}]},{"text":"문장","meaning":"句子","explanation":"문장修饰간，组成“句子之间”。","readings":[{"term":"문장","audio":"/audio/22f146433241fd2aa3fe.mp3"}]},{"text":"간의","meaning":"之间的","explanation":"간（之间）+ 의（修饰关系）。","readings":[{"term":"간의","audio":"/audio/f96aa5adaeaa3ef33ad8.mp3"}]},{"text":"연결과","meaning":"衔接和","explanation":"연결（连接、衔接）+ 과（和）。","readings":[{"term":"연결과","audio":"/audio/68a5343364ba55a6ddf9.mp3"}]},{"text":"문체의","meaning":"文体的","explanation":"문체（文体）+ 의（所属关系）。","readings":[{"term":"문체","audio":"/audio/b57d0f42b7a12ad54a19.mp3"}]},{"text":"일관성을","meaning":"一致性","explanation":"일관성（一致性）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"일관성","audio":"/audio/3ec6c9b52005ff80e471.mp3"}]},{"text":"점검하겠습니다.","meaning":"我会检查","explanation":"점검하다（检查）+ -겠-（意愿）+ -습니다（正式礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"점검하겠습니다","audio":"/audio/661f89e811d9d08904c4.mp3"}]}]}],"day":176,"sequence